The ed3k specification is placed in the public domain.

This covers every file in this repository: Protocol.md, the extensions, the
design notes and comparisons, the scripts and the test vectors.

Anyone may copy, change, publish, implement and distribute it, in whole or in
part, for any purpose, commercial or not, without asking and without naming
the authors.

Where the law does not allow a work to be placed in the public domain, the
authors grant everyone the same rights without conditions, for all time and
in all countries.

The specification is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.
